The generic `GetFieldUINT16Value` performs subfield dispatch for a fixed main field; accessing field 61 directly avoids that extra lookup while preserving the same invalid/type checks.

```cpp
    FIT_UINT16 GetRepetitionNum(void) const
    {
        const Field* field = GetField(61);
        if (field && (field->GetType() == FIT_BASE_TYPE_UINT16))
        {
            return field->GetValueUINT16(0);
        }
        return FIT_UINT16_INVALID;
    }
```